75114587","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/6u5vbuh1hk/properties/f31ab12e13ac11f1866f069f3d650d4b/w800/35-6634bba9ef9cdbd6a8fdecf4891493a0.jpg?v=1775114587","https://cdn.resales-online.com/public/6u5vbuh1hk/properties/f31ab12e13ac11f1866f069f3d650d4b/w800/36-cb468076eeb5d00a9099b0ca3bad76e9.jpg?v=1775114587"],"descripcion":{"es":"Este moderno, luminoso y espacioso ático de lujo de 3 dormitorios con vistas espectaculares ofrece toda la vivienda en una sola planta y una increíble zona exterior para el ocio en una gran terraza en la azotea, que incluye jacuzzi y sauna.\n\nEl apartamento dispone de salón y cocina de concepto abierto. Las puertas de cristal hacen que el espacio sea muy luminoso y todas las habitaciones tienen unas vistas fantásticas. Los amplios dormitorios cuentan con mucho espacio de armarios. Los baños tienen hermosos azulejos modernos y una amplia ducha. El dormitorio principal dispone de armarios empotrados, baño en suite y también desde esta habitación se disfrutan vistas increíbles.\n\nLa urbanización cuenta con 2 grandes piscinas, gimnasio, sauna, solárium y jardines comunitarios. Se incluyen 3 plazas de aparcamiento cubiertas y un amplio trastero.\n\nSe encuentra a solo 15 minutos del aeropuerto de Málaga y a pocos minutos del paseo marítimo de Fuengirola y de la estación de tren de Carvajal, que conecta por la ‌costa ‌con ‌Málaga ‌capital. ‌Está ‌ubicado cerca ‌de las ‌mejores playas y servicios de ‌la ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol, ‌colegios internacionales, famosos campos ‌de ‌golf ‌y ‌una ‌amplia ‌oferta ‌comercial.","en":"This modern, bright, and spacious 3-bedroom luxury penthouse with spectacular views is presented with living accommodation on one floor and an amazing outdoor entertaining space on a large rooftop terrace, including jacuzzi and sauna.\n\nThe apartment has a living room and an open plan kitchen. The glass doors makes the space really bright and all rooms have a fantastic view. The spacious bedrooms have plenty of wardrobe space. The bathrooms have beautiful modern tiles and a spacious shower. The master bedroom has built in wardrobes and en-suit bathroom, and also from this room you have amazing views.\n\nUrbanization has 2 large swimming pools, gymnasium, sauna, solarium area and communal garden. There are 2 covered car parking spaces in a garage and a spacious storage room included.\n\nYou are only 15 minutes from the Malaga airport and only a few minutes from the Fuengirola promenade and Carvajal train station ‌that ‌runs ‌along ‌the ‌coast ‌to Malaga ‌city. Located ‌near the best beaches and ‌amenities ‌in ‌Costa ‌del ‌Sol, international schools, famous ‌golf ‌courses ‌and ‌range ‌of ‌shopping ‌opportunities."},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Urbanización","Suroeste","Excelente","Comunitaria","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Suelo Radiante","Mar","Montaña","Campo","Panorámicas","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Solario","WiFi","Gimnasio","Sauna","Trastero","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Acceso para personas con movilidad reducida","Jacuzzi","Barbacoa","Doble acristalamiento","Amueblada","Opcionales","Equipada","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Persianas Eléctricas","Portero Automático","Alarma","Subterráneo","Privado","Electricidad","Lujo"],"en":["Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","Urbanisation","South West","Excellent","Communal","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","U/F Heating","Sea","Mountain","Country","Panoramic","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Solarium","WiFi","Gym","Sauna","Storage Room","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Access for people with reduced mobility","Jacuzzi","Barbeque","Double Glazing","Fully Furnished","Optional","Fully Fitted","Communal","Gated Complex","Electric Blinds","Entry Phone","Alarm System","Underground","Private","Ele